{"synopsis":"Mengikuti saran dari teman khayalannya, Jason, yang memberitahunya, “Perlakukan semua cewek seperti batu,” Park Jin-yong mulai melihat setiap perempuan sebagai batu. Namun kemudian Sunwoo, seorang siswi yang sama sekali tidak terlihat seperti batu, muncul di hadapannya, dan untuk pertama kalinya dalam lima tahun, pemandangan wajah seorang gadis sukses membuat sirkuit-sirkuit kecil kebahagiaan Jinyong bekerja gila-gilaan…","alternative_title":"너만 보인단 말이야","author":"Chae-Gun","artist":"Dodge (II)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"6281f7c4-1897-4380-a98f-b5a0def5da3a","number":"22","chapter":"22","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02"},{"chapter_id":"abd1af56-d670-4ca3-91a8-5db7c05881be","number":"21","chapter":"21","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02"},{"chapter_id":"11422b44-e060-4d77-8edc-d6b8c1494a49","number":"20","chapter":"20","title":"","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18"},{"chapter_id":"e3f8ced0-6f14-48c0-8da7-47142cb2bff9","number":"19","chapter":"19","title":"","date":"2026-07-10","released":"2026-07-10"},{"chapter_id":"abcdbaa9-a335-46b4-a34c-8e1404751cbf","number":"18","chapter":"18","title":"","date":"2026-07-04","released":"2026-07-04"},{"chapter_id":"929adf5f-1d1b-4564-9589-45d1ea5d2987","number":"17","chapter":"17","title":"","date":"2026-06-25","released":"2026-06-25"},{"chapter_id":"f5b62099-4386-4b04-94fa-20321ddca201","number":"16","chapter":"16","title":"","date":"2026-06-17","released":"2026-06-17"},{"chapter_id":"e345d3ee-42df-4a72-a61f-ae38dc00445c","number":"15","chapter":"15","title":"","date":"2026-06-11","released":"2026-06-11"},{"chapter_id":"50979c33-d26c-4e2e-9aa0-5828cb86a448","number":"14","chapter":"14","title":"","date":"2026-06-02","released":"2026-06-02"},{"chapter_id":"a430ac79-9aac-4f6c-bdea-3c59666cfeaf","number":"13","chapter":"13","title":"","date":"2026-06-02","released":"2026-06-02"},{"chapter_id":"e1fc2463-2e46-4cf9-bc64-b291bb3bef1d","number":"12","chapter":"12","title":"","